    html_css_rendering_inventory_lexical_false_pass_2026-09-05, 1113, "2026-11-13 UI batch B (linux aarch64, seed, release 35144b7f5e93): LIVE, blocked on host. Lexical checker still feeds three aggregate gates; rewiring them to WebRenderableFeatureInventory needs the Electron/bitmap evidence lanes, and this host has no Chrome/Electron; stays open"
    html_css_rendering_inventory_lexical_false_pass_2026-09-05, 0, "2026-11-28 p3sweep5: demonstrated the false pass - mangling every </style> to </styl> in the fixture still passed the lexical gate 389/389 while the real renderer collapsed to 1 Draw IR command / 0 colored rects. Fix: new web_renderable_feature_render_oracle.spl - each inventory row gets a focused witness fixture + declaration-free control rendered through the production layout/paint path (320x240) with canonical Draw IR fingerprints required to differ; non-renderable rows declined fail-closed; 4 structural rows get document-presence verdicts; lexical census kept as a secondary signal only. web_renderable_feature_witness.spl extracted shared example docs (byte-identical, contract-spec verified). Spec web_renderable_feature_render_oracle_spec 5/5 PASS (incl per-row false-pass regression: declaration injected only as /* */ stylesheet text -> lexical fires, oracle declines); inventory contract 13/13; neighbours 13/13 + 2/2. Found + recorded css_rule_body_comment_decl_leak_2026-11-28 (declarations inside rule-body /* */ after a ; leak into the cascade - naive ; split). Residuals: the three aggregate shell gates still call the lexical checker (need an Electron/bitmap host to rewire - deferred per the doc); 1 pre-existing media-tile pixel failure unrelated. close_evidence reproducer=test/01_unit/lib/gc_async_mut/gpu/browser_engine/web_renderable_feature_render_oracle_spec.spl prevention=test/01_unit/lib/gc_async_mut/gpu/browser_engine/web_renderable_feature_inventory_contract_spec.spl"

